 "notes": [
  "(a) Pilot: sampling undocumented, unweighted, no written codebook; bootstrap CIs over records (1000, seed 42). (b-f) R1 audit (frozen protocol, Multimedia Appendix 1, Note 9): KEEP = discourse or evaluative. Estimates are weighted by frame size / sample size per stratum-year cell; Jeffreys intervals from 10,000 draws of each cell's Beta(k+1/2, n-k+1/2) posterior (seed 42; Amendment 3); single cells use the exact Clopper-Pearson interval. The full-abstract 2x2 uses the within-cell bootstrap because its sub-cells are too small for the Jeffreys prior (Amendment 3). The one unlabelled record counts as an error of the classifier being evaluated (Amendment 2). The intra-rater κ interval is wide because only 1 of 20 records disagreed."
 ],
